DestroyFunc MouseDrag
AddToFunc   MouseDrag
+ I Raise
+ M $0
+ D $1

DestroyFunc MaxCenter
AddToFunc   MaxCenter
+ I Maximize 75 100
+ I Current (Maximized) Move 50-50w 50-50w Warp

DestroyFunc ResizeWarp
AddToFunc   ResizeWarp
+ I Resize $0 $1
+ I WarpToWindow 50 50

# mouse bindings
Mouse 1      R N  Menu rootmenu

Mouse 1     FS A  MouseDrag Resize
Mouse 2     FS A  MouseDrag Move
Mouse 3     FS A  MouseDrag Move

Mouse 1    FSW 4  MouseDrag Move
Mouse 2    FSW 4  Iconify
Mouse 3    FSW 4  MouseDrag "Resize Direction SE warptoborder"

# title bar bindings
Mouse 1      T A  MouseDrag Move Maximize
Mouse 1      1 A  Menu windowops
Mouse 1      2 A  Close
Mouse 1      4 A  Maximize
Mouse 2      4 A  Maximize 0 100
Mouse 1      6 A  Iconify
Mouse 2      6 A  Lower

# key bindings
Key   d      A 4  Exec exec $[infostore.runcmd]
Key   d      A 4S Menu rootmenu
Key   Return A 4  Exec exec $[infostore.termcmd]

Key   Print  A N  Exec exec $[infostore.scrotcmd]
Key   Print  A 4  Exec exec $[infostore.scrotcmd] s

# basic window management
Key   q      A 4  Iconify
Key   q      A 4S Close

Key   r      A 4  Raise
Key   r      A 4S Lower
Key   Tab    A 4  Next (CurrentPage, !Focused, !Iconic, AcceptsFocus) WarpToWindow 50 50

Key   f      A 4  Maximize
Key   f      A 4S Maximize Fullscreen
Key   v      A 4  Maximize 0 100
Key   v      A 4S Maximize 100 0
Key   Space  A 4  MaxCenter

# desks
Key 1        A 4  GotoPage 0 0
Key 2        A 4  GotoPage 1 0
Key 3        A 4  GotoPage 0 1
Key 4        A 4  GotoPage 1 1

Key 1        A 4S MoveToPage 0 0
Key 2        A 4S MoveToPage 1 0
Key 3        A 4S MoveToPage 0 1
Key 4        A 4S MoveToPage 1 1

# y u |  k
#  g  | h l
# b n |  j
# manipulate windows
Key g        A 4  Move 50-50w 50-50w Warp
Key y        A 4  Move 0 0 Warp
Key u        A 4  Move 100-100w 0 Warp
Key b        A 4  Move 0 100-100w Warp
Key n        A 4  Move 100-100w 100-100w Warp

Key h        A 4  Move w-100p keep Warp
Key j        A 4  Move keep w+100p Warp
Key k        A 4  Move keep w-100p Warp
Key l        A 4  Move w+100p keep Warp

Key h        A 4C Move shuffle Warp left
Key j        A 4C Move shuffle Warp down
Key k        A 4C Move shuffle Warp up
Key l        A 4C Move shuffle Warp right

Key h        A 4S ResizeWarp w-100p keep
Key j        A 4S ResizeWarp keep w+100p
Key k        A 4S ResizeWarp keep w-100p
Key l        A 4S ResizeWarp w+100p keep

